            "action_name": {
              "value": "Smite Good"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Drustan selects one enemy he can see. Until the start of his next turn, his bastard sword Strikes against that foe deal an additional 6 evil damage. If the chosen enemy attacks Drustan before the start of his next turn, the duration extends to the end of that enemy's next turn."
